ed. Send quantities by color and size, destination and packing requirements for a quotation. Measurements, international size conversion, availability and requested dispatch dates are confirmed for your order.</value></field><field id="companyDesc" type="input"><value>Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear &amp; Apparel Co., Ltd. supports footwear wholesale inquiries. These company capability images describe general business capabilities. Product-specific supply, samples, customization, packing and dispatch are assessed against your order requirements before quotation.</value></field><field id="companyFaqDesc" type="multiComplex"><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Which materials are specified?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>The shaft lining is artificial long plush and the insole is artificial short plush. Exact upper composition, outsole and midsole materials are not specified. Include your material requirements when requesting a quotation.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Which colors and sizes are offered?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Khaki, Black and Cream with size labels 35-42. Send quantities for each color and size. Foot measurements and international size conversions are confirmed for the order.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>How do the boots close?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>These boots have a side zipper and quilted upper panels, as shown in the actual product photos.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Can I request samples or customization?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Send your sample quantity or customization requirements with your color-size mix. Feasibility, charges, packing or logo options and any applicable minimums are confirmed before quotation.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>How is availability and dispatch confirmed?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Provide quantities by color and size, destination and requested dispatch date. Per-size availability, packing, payment and dispatch terms are assessed for your order before quotation.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>What are the minimum and quantity prices?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>The listing minimum is 2 pairs. Indicative prices are USD 11.87 for 2-49 pairs, USD 11.08 for 50-99 pairs and USD 10.29 for 100 or more pairs. Final quotation depends on the color-size mix, packing and agreed order terms; freight and taxes are confirmed separately.</value></field></complex-values></field></itemSchema>